Package: ptscotch-intel-mpich-ohpc
Architecture: any
Depends: ohpc-filesystem, intel-compilers-devel-ohpc, mpich-intel-ohpc, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Graph, mesh and hypergraph partitioning library - MPI variant (intel + mpich, OpenHPC)
 Scotch is a software package for graph and mesh/hypergraph partitioning and
 sparse matrix ordering. PT-Scotch is the parallel (MPI) variant.
 Built with the Intel compiler family and mpich MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
